senses.gloss:
चित्रिन्, ई, इणी, इ, containing wonders, wonderful;
variegated; having variegated (black and grey) hair;
(इण्यस्), f. pl. wonderful deeds; (इणी), f., N. for a
woman endowed with various talents and excellencies,
one of the four divisions into which women are
classed by erotic writers.
